+# LANE-TRUTH-BATCH-01 summary
+
+## Verdicts
+
+| Row | Verdict | Proof |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| `LANE-LIVENESS-BLIND-TO-FUNNEL-PATH-01` | fixed | `plugins/leadv2/scripts/leadv2-active-registry.sh:418` has the guarded `set_log_path` operation; `plugins/leadv2/scripts/leadv2-dispatch-code.sh:3075` stamps the dispatch stream path after registration. The hermetic test creates only the stream and proves liveness is `alive` from its mtime, not a status field or a task handoff directory. |
+| `LANE-REGISTRATION-ONLY-ON-FANOUT-PATH-01` | fixed | `plugins/leadv2/scripts/leadv2-dispatch-code.sh:3069` uses `dispatch-<sig8>` when no founder task ID exists, and line 3076 stamps its authoritative stream path. The hermetic test proves the direct-lane registration key and path. |
+| `UNLANDED-FIXES-IN-USER-SCRIPTS-COPIES-01` | fixed | `plugins/leadv2/scripts/leadv2-plugin-sync.sh:191` quarantines a divergent copy before exclusion; the original remains excluded. The hermetic test proves dry-run creates no quarantine and a real run retains the un-landed content under the configured quarantine root. |
+
+## Validation
+
+- `bash plugins/leadv2/scripts/tests/test-lane-truth-batch-01.sh` — rc=0, 12 assertions passed.
+- `bash plugins/leadv2/scripts/tests/run-core-offline.sh` — blocked before this lane's suite by pre-existing `dispatch refusal fallback chain`: `test-routing-enforcement-p1.sh` rc=2 after `sysmond service not found` / `pgrep: Cannot get process list`. No routing files were changed by this lane.
+
+The added lane test is included in `run-core-offline.sh` for future full-suite coverage.
